    },
    "message": "Spread a rumor through a generated Scenario in the information tests\n\nThe first two tests ran scenario_100_agents on the sparse information policy,\nwhich the UI does not install. They now run the shared generated Scenario\n(evidence-aware-rumor-v1, real households) with the test transmission\ncoefficients over its config. Because that policy accepts a heard claim with\na probability, the local-contact test checks the contact trace: the origin's\ncontacts are same-zone, adjacent or family only, and neither a household member\nnor a person living alone in a non-adjacent area is contacted.\n\nPart of #137.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
