    },
    "message": "Add a generated Scenario run to the stress propagation test\n\nThe earlier sparse policy (schema 5) keeps its fixture test. The new test runs\nthe generated Scenario for 15 minutes, since contacts count only after five\nminutes together, and checks that the trace is not empty before its limits.\n\nPart of #137.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
