    "message": "Expect every recovery of a generated Scenario to be recorded (xfail #159)\n\nStaff support on the generated Scenario lowers distress during event handling,\nwhich the distress monitor does not count as a recovery. The test passes with\nthe monitor closing any open run once distress is below the threshold.\n\nPart of #137.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
